---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";

---
<Base title="About me" description="Experience, education, tools and the manifesto of Stanislav Ermolenko: XR and WebXR, AI automation, digital archives and media, work with business, museums and cultural projects." lang="en" pageType="AboutPage">
  <div class="about-page">
    <header class="catalog-hero about-hero">
      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <div class="section-kicker">Stanislav Ermolenko</div>
        <h1>Not a one-button<br />person</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">Born in 1994 in Vyatka, based in St. Petersburg. I connect technology, memory, media and place: I make XR worlds, automation, digital archives, texts and video wherever a single tool is no longer enough</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="mailto:stas@staniverse.xyz">Write to me</a><a class="button" href="/cv/Stanislav-Ermolenko-CV-RU.pdf" download>Download CV</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero-note"><span class="section-kicker">Now</span><p>I work at the intersection of XR, AI, web and media. I study in ITMO&rsquo;s master&rsquo;s programme (2026 – present).</p><a class="text-link" href="#path">To experience and education <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </header>

    <section class="section about-intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Where this grows from</div><h2 id="intro-title">One interest,<br />many forms</h2></div></div>
      <div class="about-intro-grid"><p>I am one of those people who cannot be a one-button person. At the age of three I took apart a &ldquo;Mayak&rdquo; tape recorder, failed to put it back together, but understood how it was built. I have worked much the same way ever since: I connect things, watch what comes out, and look for the hidden snags.</p><p>Everything I do grows out of one question: how technology helps a person remember, understand, be present and not lose their way.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-directions" aria-labelledby="directions-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Directions</div><h2 id="directions-title">What I do</h2></div></div>
      <div class="direction-grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>XR and virtual spaces</h3><p>I invent and build worlds you can step into and interact with.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>AI agents and automation</h3><p>I set up systems so that people have more time for what is alive and complex.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Media</h3><p>A story no one has told disappears. So I shoot, edit and assemble archives.</p></article>
        <article><span>04</span><h3>Web and products</h3><p>I turn ideas into clear interfaces, services and durable workflows.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-path" id="path" aria-labelledby="path-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Path</div><h2 id="path-title">Experience and education</h2></div></div>
      <div class="about-path-grid">
        <ol class="about-timeline">
          <li><time>2015 – 2023</time><div><strong>VyatSU Media Centre</strong><span>Computer operator and project curator</span></div></li>
          <li><time>2023 – present</time><div><strong>Self-employed / freelance</strong><span>Automation, GenAI, XR, Web, Media</span></div></li>
          <li><time>2023 – 2026</time><div><strong>&ldquo;Digital Departments&rdquo;, VyatSU</strong><span>Lecturer and methodologist; in summer 2026 I put together the course &ldquo;Fundamentals of Product Management&rdquo;</span></div></li>
          <li><time>2025 – present</time><div><strong>Information systems specialist</strong></div></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="education-list">
          <article><time>2026 – present</time><h3>ITMO, master&rsquo;s programme</h3><p>&ldquo;Digital Methods in the Humanities&rdquo; (Digital Humanities), field 45.04.04 &ldquo;Intelligent Systems in the Humanitarian Environment&rdquo;.</p></article>
          <article><time>2026</time><h3>Bachelor in State and Municipal Administration, VyatSU</h3></article>
          <article><time>2026</time><h3>Somnium Space Academy</h3></article>
          <article><time>2026</time><h3>Agents Week, Yandex School of Data Analysis</h3></article>
          <article><time>2026</time><h3>Premasters Art&amp;Science, ITMO</h3></article>
          <article><time>2025</time><h3>VR development with Unity and the XR Interaction Toolkit, Stepik</h3></article>
          <article><time>2024</time><h3>Internet marketing and law, further professional education at VyatSU</h3></article>
          <article><time>2024</time><h3>Digital Autumn: Changing Perspective</h3><p>An XR intensive.</p></article>
          <article><time>2024</time><h3>Unity Essential Pathway</h3></article>
          <article><time>2022</time><h3>&ldquo;Modern Digital Technologies&rdquo;, VyatSU</h3></article>
          <article><time>2021</time><h3>Digital technologies in journalism and PR, further professional education at VyatSU</h3></article>
          <article><time>2015</time><h3>MB110x: Introduction to the Music Business</h3><p>Berklee College of Music via edX.</p></article>
          <article><time>2015</time><h3>BMPR365x: Vocal Recording Technology</h3><p>Berklee College of Music via edX.</p></article>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://disk.yandex.ru/d/Wo6AjBBq8fJomA" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Supporting documents <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-tools" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Tools</div><h2 id="tools-title">From Unity<br />to a soldering iron</h2></div></div>
      <div class="tools-grid">
        <div><h3>XR</h3><p>Unity, Blender, Substance, WebXR, 8th Wall, Three.js</p></div>
        <div><h3>AI and agents</h3><p>n8n, LangChain, LangGraph, Dify, Supabase, Neo4j, ComfyUI, Python</p></div>
        <div><h3>Harnesses</h3><p>Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, OpenClaw, Hermes, Pico Claw, pi</p></div>
        <div><h3>Web</h3><p>Tilda, Astro, Quartz, WordPress, WooCommerce, Telegram Bot API, CRM</p></div>
        <div><h3>IoT and infrastructure</h3><p>Arduino, ESP, Raspberry Pi, Home Assistant, Linux, Docker, Nginx, OpenWrt</p></div>
        <div><h3>Media</h3><p>DaVinci Resolve, Adobe Premiere, Photoshop, OBS Studio</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-achievements" aria-labelledby="achievements-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Achievements</div><h2 id="achievements-title">From TV journalism<br />to virtual worlds</h2></div></div>
      <ul class="achievement-list">
        <li><strong>Prize-winner of the XV Russian Youth Delphic Games</strong><span>TV journalism, Tyumen, 2016</span></li>
        <li><strong>Winner of &ldquo;MediaMaster 2019&rdquo;</strong><span>Blogger of the Year, Kirov</span></li>
        <li><strong>Finalist, &ldquo;Best Student Media Project&rdquo;</strong><span>International forum &ldquo;The Space of Eurasia&rdquo;, Moscow, 2019</span></li>
        <li><strong>Top 10 at ArtMasters 2025</strong><span>&ldquo;Virtual World Designer&rdquo; competency, Moscow</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-manifesto" id="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
      <div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">Manifesto</div><h2 id="manifesto-title">How I actually<br />understand all of this</h2></div></div>
      <div class="manifesto-teaser">
        <p>About the connections between technology, memory, media and place — and about why the human dimension of the future matters to me more than another showcase of technology.</p>
        <a class="button quiet" href="/manifesto/">Read the manifesto</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div><div class="section-kicker">Contacts and media</div><h2 id="contact-title">Let&rsquo;s keep talking</h2></div>
      <div class="about-contact-links"><a href="mailto:stas@staniverse.xyz">stas@staniverse.xyz</a><a href="https://t.me/staniverse" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Telegram @staniverse <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@staniverse" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YouTube @staniverse <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@yatygorod" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YouTube @yatygorod <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  /* The page runs on the site tokens and the shared 12/6/4 grid: only the
     composition of the hero, the timeline and the education list is local. */
  .about-page .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--grid-gap) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-hero-copy { grid-column: span 7; }
  .about-page .about-hero h1 { max-width: 12ch; margin: var(--s-1) 0 var(--s-4); font: 650 var(--text-h1) / .98 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.04em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .about-hero-note { grid-column: span 5; align-self: end; max-width: 25rem; padding-top: var(--s-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .about-hero-note p { margin: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-4); font-size: var(--text-body); line-height: 1.55; }

  .about-intro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--grid-gap) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .about-intro-grid p { grid-column: span 6; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; }

  .direction-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-4) var(--s-3); }
  .direction-grid article { grid-column: span 3; min-height: 12rem; padding-top: var(--s-3); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .direction-grid span { color: var(--accent); font-size: var(--text-label); letter-spacing: var(--track-label); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .direction-grid h3 { max-width: 15rem; margin: var(--s-5) 0 var(--s-2); font: 500 var(--text-h3) / 1.3 var(--font-display); }
  .direction-grid p { max-width: 15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.55; }

  .about-path-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-4) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: start; }
  /* The timeline keeps its own spacing: stretched to the height of the education
     list beside it, four short entries drifted apart with no relation to content. */
  .about-timeline { grid-column: span 7; position: relative; display: grid; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .about-timeline::before { position: absolute; top: .4rem; bottom: .4rem; left: .2rem; width: 1px; background: var(--line); content: ""; }
  .about-timeline li { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 8rem 1fr; gap: var(--s-3); padding: 0 0 var(--s-5) var(--s-4); }
  .about-timeline li::before { position: absolute; top: .3rem; left: 0; width: .4rem; height: .4rem; background: var(--accent); content: ""; }
  .about-timeline time, .education-list time { color: var(--accent); font-size: .72rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .about-timeline strong { display: block; color: var(--ink); font-size: .95rem; }
  .about-timeline span { display: block; margin-top: var(--s-1); color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .8rem; }
  .education-list { grid-column: span 5; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .education-list article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr; gap: var(--s-3); padding: var(--s-3) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .education-list h3 { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .education-list p { grid-column: 2; margin: -.25rem 0 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.5; }

  .tools-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 var(--s-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tools-grid div { grid-column: span 4; padding: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-4); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .tools-grid h3 { margin: 0 0 var(--s-2); font: 500 var(--text-h3) / 1.3 var(--font-display); }
  .tools-grid p { max-width: 22rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.55; }

  .achievement-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 0 var(--s-5); margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .achievement-list li { grid-column: span 6; padding: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-4); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .achievement-list strong, .achievement-list span { display: block; }
  .achievement-list strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.35; }
  .achievement-list span { margin-top: var(--s-1); color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .8rem; }

  .manifesto-teaser { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(12rem, 1fr); gap: var(--s-5); align-items: end; max-width: 58rem; padding-top: var(--s-4); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .manifesto-teaser p { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .manifesto-teaser .button { justify-self: end; }

  .about-contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--grid-columns), minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-4) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .about-contact > *:first-child { grid-column: span 5; }
  .about-contact h2 { margin: var(--s-1) 0 0; font: 500 var(--text-h2) / 1.08 var(--font-display); text-wrap: balance; }
  .about-contact-links { grid-column: span 7; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-content: start; gap: 0 var(--s-4); }
  .about-contact-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: .85rem; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--line-strong); text-underline-offset: .25rem; }
  .about-contact-links a:hover,
  .about-contact-links a:focus-visible { color: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .about-hero-copy, .about-hero-note, .about-timeline, .education-list,
    .about-contact > *:first-child, .about-contact-links { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .about-hero-note { max-width: 34rem; }
    .about-intro-grid p { grid-column: span 3; }
    .direction-grid article { grid-column: span 3; }
    .tools-grid div { grid-column: span 3; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .manifesto-teaser { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-4); }
    .manifesto-teaser .button { justify-self: start; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-hero-copy, .about-hero-note, .about-timeline, .education-list,
    .about-intro-grid p, .direction-grid article, .tools-grid div,
    .achievement-list li, .about-contact > *:first-child, .about-contact-links { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .direction-grid article { min-height: 0; }
    .about-timeline li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-1); }
    .education-list article { grid-template-columns: 3.4rem 1fr; }
    .education-list p { grid-column: 2; }
  }
</style>
